No.  It checks whether you're in hell; however, it also checks for 
the alignment.  The relevant part in pray.c, as far as I can see, is   

   /* An unaligned altar in Gehennom will always elicit rejection. */
   if (ugod_is_angry() || (altaralign == A_NONE && Inhell)) {
                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
      ..bad things happen, or you get converted (not possible 
      with unaligned altar).. 
   }

Consequently, you *could* convert aligned altars in Hell (CMIIW).  
However, currently there are no aligned altars in Hell, hence 
the effect is indistingushable from your interpretation.  


